    "body": "## Scoped Euclidean partial\n\nA verified specialization of the prior Frettl\u00f6h\u2013Garber layered family has congruent complete closed vertex-centered radius-sqrt(10) triangulation restrictions, triangle diameters at most sqrt(10), and a noncocompact full symmetry group. Its horizontal translation subgroup is exactly2Z\u00d7{0}; it is not strongly aperiodic.\n\nThe original source does not define periodicity. This result refutes the Euclidean cocompact/rank-two interpretation only; no hyperbolic full-ball classification, unconditional source solution or historical novelty is claimed. Proposed QUEUE outcome remains unsolved, original1/5 preserved.\n\nThree independent complete mathematical/source families and root audit PASS, including all restricted cells and boundary-only incidences, universal locality, all ambient symmetry classes and exact primary/prior scope. Historical16 rooted cases/212 assertions reproduce byte identically; fresh controls1398/888/158 pass. A new complete gate on the corrected current package is pending. This is extensive AI/unrefereed review, not human peer review.\n\nOriginal scope includes16 numeric attempt files plus the selected QUEUE row. Current acceptance also includes the program audit and transparently recorded accepted-state mirror after remote integration. Original proof scientific sections, source/history/scripts/receipts and ledger are preserved. No paper, deposit/DOI or tracker row is warranted.\n",
